# Bien moi truong cua AI Learn. Huong dan dat vao he thong (local, Docker,
# ECS) va cach dung tung khoi: docs/env.md
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# `npm start` doc file nay bang --env-file-if-exists cua Node, khong co dotenv.
# Trong container thi docker-compose.yml bom vao qua `env_file: .env`.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- bat buoc
#
# Thieu cai nay la server thoat ngay luc khoi dong. Tat ca bien con lai deu co
# mac dinh hoac tu tat tinh nang cua no.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- model
REALTIME_MODEL=gpt-realtime

GRADER_TEXT_MODEL=gpt-4o

# De trong = tat han khau cham phat am. Buoi hoc van co summary text binh
# thuong, chi mat phan cham tren file WAV.
GRADER_AUDIO_MODEL=gpt-4o-audio-preview

PORT=3000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- han muc
#
# Thoi luong goi mien phi moi thiet bi moi ngay, tinh bang thoi gian ket noi
# THAT chu khong phai so luot. Mac dinh 300000 = 5 phut — demo mot lat la het,
# nen luc test thuong phai day len.
# DAILY_QUOTA_MS=300000

# Moc cat ngay de reset han muc, lech so voi UTC. Mac dinh 25200000 = GMT+7.
# QUOTA_TZ_OFFSET_MS=25200000

# ----------------------------------------------------------- luu tru audio
#
# disk (mac dinh): WAV di xuyen qua backend roi nam o data/audio/.
# s3:              client day thang len bucket bang presigned POST policy,
#                  backend chi nhan metadata {key, bytes, durationMs}.
#
# Bat s3 ma thieu bat ky bien nao trong bon bien duoi thi nga ra ngay luc khoi
# dong, khong de den luc nguoi hoc noi xong cau dau tien moi biet khong luu
# duoc. Doi qua lai giua hai kieu thi cac buoi cu van nghe lai binh thuong:
# moi message ghi kem `audio_store` cua chinh no.
AUDIO_STORE=disk

S3_REGION=ap-southeast-1
S3_BUCKET=ai-learn-audio
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=

# Chi de dev voi MinIO — `npm run test:s3` tu dat bien nay. Co gia tri thi URL
# doi sang path-style (endpoint/bucket/key). Tro vao S3 that thi de trong.
# S3_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:9000

# Chi can khi chay bang credential tam (vd IAM role tren EC2/ECS). Dat vao thi
# ca S3, Polly va STS deu tu them header x-amz-security-token.
# AWS_SESSION_TOKEN=


# ------------------------------------------------------------------ Polly
#
# TIENG NOI CUA AI. Session Realtime chay output_modalities:["text"] — OpenAI
# chi nghe va tra ve chu, con doc thanh tieng la viec cua Polly.
#
# Polly tra audio KEM viseme timeline (speech marks) nen avatar nhep dung AM VI
# chu khong phai doan tu pho am thanh.
#
# Tat (mac dinh) = AI chi hien chu, khong co tieng.
#
# Client tu goi Polly, khong qua backend — nen con can POLLY_STS_ROLE_ARN o duoi.
POLLY=off

# De trong thi lay theo S3_REGION. Khong co ca hai thi nga ra luc khoi dong.
# POLLY_REGION=ap-southeast-1

# Chi la MAC DINH cho nguoi chua tung chon: nguoi hoc doi giong ngay tren man
# hoc va lua chon do nam trong localStorage cua ho.
POLLY_VOICE=Joanna

# standard | neural | long-form. KHONG dung duoc `generative`: engine do
# khong tra speech marks (ValidationException).
# Cung la MAC DINH — nguoi hoc doi duoc, giong nhu POLLY_VOICE.
POLLY_ENGINE=neural

# ------------------------------- Polly tu client (STS) ---------------------
#
# Client tu ky va goi thang Polly, khong qua backend: khuc DAU TIEN cua moi
# luot la toan bo do tre nguoi dung cam thay, va mot vong round trip qua backend
# nam dung tren duong nong do.
#
# Nghia la credential PHAI xuong toi browser. Hai duong, chon bang bien duoi:
#
#   De TRONG  -> demo. Credential AWS o tren di thang xuong browser: khong han
#                that, khong rang IP, mang du quyen cua IAM user do. Chay duoc
#                ngay, khong phai dung role. Server bao mot dong log moi lan
#                khoi dong de khong ai quen mat minh dang o che do nay.
#
#   Co ROLE   -> production. Backend AssumeRole ra credential tam, session
#                policy rang vao IP client va cat han xuong duoi san 900 giay.
#
# Role phai:
#   - cho `polly:SynthesizeSpeech` (session policy chi THU HEP them, khong
#     cong quyen vao)
#   - tin tuong AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID o tren trong trust policy
#   - khong cho gi khac: credential nam trong browser, ban kinh thiet hai phai
#     dung o hoa don Polly
# POLLY_STS_ROLE_ARN=arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/ai-learn-polly-client

# Han cua credential, giay. AWS chan trong 900..3600 (900 la san cua
# AssumeRole; 3600 la MaxSessionDuration mac dinh cua mot role moi tao).
# Mot buoi hoc ngan hon nhieu, nen ky mot lan la du ca buoi.
#
# O duong THANG day chi la han BIA — credential dai han khong het han bao gio,
# con so nay chi de client giu nguyen vong xin lai.
POLLY_STS_TTL_SEC=3600

# Rang credential vao IP cua chinh client (`aws:SourceIp`). Lay di cung chi
# dung duoc tu dung may do. Khong co tac dung o duong THANG: khong co session
# policy nao de rang.
#
# Tat khi backend nam sau reverse proxy KHONG dat X-Forwarded-For — luc do moi
# nguoi deu chung mot IP noi bo, rang vao vua khong chan duoc ai vua lam
# credential chet oan. IP loopback/private thi code tu bo qua.
POLLY_STS_BIND_IP=on

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- CDN
#
# De trong CA KHOI thi van nghe lai duoc, chi la moi file mot presigned GET
# rieng thang tu S3.
#
# CDN_DOMAIN=media.example.com

# --- Distribution PUBLIC: dung mot minh CDN_DOMAIN o tren, het. ------------
#
# Khong co gi de ky khi behavior khong gan trusted key group. Doi lai URL phat
# ra song mai: lo mot link la lo han file do, va file o day la giong nguoi hoc.
# Rao chan con lai chi la sessionId (randomUUID, khong doan duoc).

# --- Distribution CO KY: them ca hai bien duoi. ----------------------------
#
# Dat MOT nua thoi thi server nga ra luc khoi dong, khong am tham tut ve URL
# tran — go nham ten bien ma tut ve thi trieu chung se la 403 o tan trinh duyet
# nguoi hoc, cach xa nguyen nhan.
#
# CDN phai cung site voi app (vd app.example.com + media.example.com), neu
# khong trinh duyet se khong dinh kem signed cookie.
# CF_KEY_PAIR_ID=

# Private key cua CloudFront: dat MOT trong hai. CF_PRIVATE_KEY duoc uu tien.
#
# Trong container thi uu tien _PATH: gia tri nhieu dong trong env_file di qua
# Docker Compose khong chac nguyen ven, con mount mot file thi luon dung.
# Xem docs/env.md muc "Khoa nhieu dong".
# CF_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH=/run/secrets/cloudfront-private-key.pem
# CF_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----\n..."
